Package: com.ratush.crontweak
Name: CronTweak
Version: 1.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: crontab-syntax scheduler. Write cron-style lines (min hour dom mon dow command) in Settings, they auto-convert to native launchd LaunchDaemons.
Maintainer: chelaxian
Author: chelaxian
Section: Tweaks
Depends: preferenceloader, firmware (>= 17.0)
Icon: https://ios.ratu.sh/icons/com.ratush.crontweak.png
Homepage: https://ios.ratu.sh/
